  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. # Key legislation identified and prioritized that requires reforming as part of the implementation of the security architecture 
2. # of key stakeholders from the security sector institutions participate in discussions to increase consensus on the importance of civilian oversight of the security sector 
3. Road map/implementation plans with M&amp;E framework in place Y/N</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2022">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Constitution and current legislation  
2. Senior management in OPM, ONS, MOD, SNA, ONS, MOIS, SPF
3. No national M&amp;E framework in place</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Agreement on at least 3 pieces of legislation that shall be prioritized for reform 
2. All key institutions are represented in 4 consultation forums 
3. National M&amp;E framework in place to measure progress</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. TBC
2. Workshop conducted in Puntland with key security sector stakeholders to discuss oversight of sector. Stakeholders included MOS&amp;DDR, MOJ, Ministry of Finance, Ministry of Planning, Police, PSSO, Parliamentarians (sec. com), Human Rights Defenders Office, CSOs (MAP), Think Tanks and Good Governance and Anti-Corruption Bureau, UNSOM.
3. No national M&amp;E framework in place. 2 FMS ministry of security were supported with capacity building and training on M&amp;E to perform data collection drawn from communities to feed into the ministry&#x2019;s strategic planning and prioritization.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
